", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le18ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le18ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I have been looking forward to this dinner all week!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If you learned to cook more dishes, you wouldn't always be hungry.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If we both learned a bit more, Peter, we could whip up some food together.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I've heard on the news that overcooked food dulls your appetite.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure about that. Although, if you overcook food it will be less exciting to eat.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If we warm up our food again, won't it be overcooked?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No. If you try out a dish, slice up the vegetables nice and thick so they'll cook slower. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Uh-huh.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Then they're going to cook them less? They'll still be crunchy!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Right.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My cooking experiment starts tomorrow.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll be coming over to help.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Work starts at noon. Don't be late!", "id": 2, "time": "17550", "image": "engenn7le18ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You guys are actually going to do up your own food! I'm impressed!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If we made something from Vanessa's blog we could take a picture and post it. If you comment on it, V, it will give other people the idea. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should do that! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You can tell me how to make the dish so that I can cook it even better!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Will you do that for me then?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. You pick out the easiest recipes and we'll try it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That sounds like fun!", "id": 3, "time": "35800", "image": "engenn7le18ob11re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}